1
00:00:07,530 --> 00:00:09,330
Good morning,

2
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:12,670
ladies and gentlemen of the twelve bishops.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,010
I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince

4
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,010
so I Can Take My Time
Perfecting My Magical Ability 2nd Season

5
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:24,250
This is a holy day where we celebrate 
the advent of our God...

6
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:27,510
Pope Guitane

7
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:27,500
Let us ensure the festival is a success.

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,520
Yes, as unfortunate as the rain might be.

9
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:34,000
That's likely my fault.

10
00:00:34,370 --> 00:00:37,250
The rain tends to follow 
me around, I'm afraid.

11
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:40,730
And I'm afraid your welcome parade 
will have to be canceled.

12
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:43,010
Beyond that, the rest will 
be as you were informed...

13
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:47,700
You will each inspect different 
areas of the church,

14
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:51,060
with members of our team 
serving as your guards.

15
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:54,890
Wait, why are we being separated 
from His Holiness?!

16
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:54,910
Archbishop Ganmo

17
00:00:55,080 --> 00:00:59,900
It's part of Prince Albert's 
plan to defend us.

18
00:01:00,270 --> 00:01:06,760
Apparently, the man who attacked the 
Daen Cathedral may be something of a misotheist.

19
00:01:06,760 --> 00:01:12,160
I imagine he's counting on it being easier 
to keep us safe when we are not all together.

20
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:13,050
Yes, sir.

21
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:18,160
<i>Well, it's not like we 
can tell them the truth.</i>

22
00:01:18,570 --> 00:01:23,120
<i>That it's really to keep an eye out for 
the monster hidden among them.</i>

23
00:01:23,970 --> 00:01:29,450
Rest assured, we will do everything 
possible to keep you safe.

24
00:01:25,860 --> 00:01:29,450
Archbishop Anastasia

25
00:01:29,770 --> 00:01:34,840
We'll now escort you to your 
appointed areas for inspection,

26
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:37,140
so if you'd please enter your coaches.

27
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:41,230
Your Holiness, if you'll come this way.

28
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:50,020
Bishop Anastasia, I will be escorting you.

29
00:01:51,250 --> 00:01:53,370
I'll be in your care.

30
00:01:58,620 --> 00:02:00,460
I don't like this.

31
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:06,650
I don't need a guard. If anyone 
was stupid enough to attack me...

32
00:02:07,600 --> 00:02:11,770
Archbishop Batts

33
00:02:07,740 --> 00:02:11,320
I'd kick their ass before sending 
them straight to the Lord.

34
00:02:15,510 --> 00:02:18,950
Batts, men shouldn't run 
their mouths so much.

35
00:02:15,610 --> 00:02:21,280
Archbishop Dante

36
00:02:18,950 --> 00:02:21,270
It's all about communicating with your back.

37
00:02:21,530 --> 00:02:23,250
What're you talking about, Dante?

38
00:02:23,250 --> 00:02:25,130
Backs don't even have mouths.

39
00:02:25,130 --> 00:02:27,440
This is why you're an idiot.

40
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:31,290
Who are you calling an idiot, asshole?!

41
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:31,280
E-Excuse me...

42
00:02:31,330 --> 00:02:34,790
Archbishop Yataro

43
00:02:31,580 --> 00:02:33,990
Right this way, Bishop Dante.

44
00:02:32,260 --> 00:02:34,790
I dare you to say it again!

45
00:02:36,530 --> 00:02:39,340
Dante! We're not done, you hear me?!

46
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:43,050
Archbishop Melissa

47
00:02:40,820 --> 00:02:43,050
We're headed this way.

48
00:02:43,050 --> 00:02:44,470
Hands off, you old bag!

49
00:02:44,470 --> 00:02:46,540
I'm talking to Dante over here!

50
00:02:46,540 --> 00:02:48,120
Damn it, how are you so strong?!

51
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:50,270
Thank you for your protection.

52
00:02:54,350 --> 00:02:56,270
Not exactly friendly, is he?

53
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:59,870
Who am I supposed to be guarding?

54
00:02:59,870 --> 00:03:04,750
Gimme a hottie! I want a hottie!

55
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,590
I think it's them.

56
00:03:05,570 --> 00:03:07,910
Archbishop Akamaki

57
00:03:09,130 --> 00:03:10,840
No, there's still a chance!

58
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,490
I'm supposed to be guarding one other person!

59
00:03:12,490 --> 00:03:15,410
This time it'll be a hottie!

60
00:03:13,610 --> 00:03:15,410
Looks like that's them.

61
00:03:15,500 --> 00:03:18,420
Archbishop Aomaki

62
00:03:19,940 --> 00:03:21,160
Right this way...

63
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:23,470
What's with the doleful demeanor?!

64
00:03:23,470 --> 00:03:25,180
Get it together!

65
00:03:25,650 --> 00:03:26,990
It's you, isn't it?

66
00:03:28,860 --> 00:03:34,430
The one who said that the Daen Cathedral was 
attacked by someone dressed like a pastor.

67
00:03:31,060 --> 00:03:34,430
Archbishop Rozelis

68
00:03:34,430 --> 00:03:35,450
Right.

69
00:03:35,450 --> 00:03:40,330
And you seem to think that this person is 
actually a member of the Church, it seems.

70
00:03:40,330 --> 00:03:41,950
You wretch!

71
00:03:41,990 --> 00:03:45,700
Archbishop Thor

72
00:03:42,260 --> 00:03:45,710
How dare you insult us like that?!
What are you plotting?!

73
00:03:45,710 --> 00:03:48,400
Now, Thor, calm down.

74
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:51,670
So, do you have any leads on the attacker?

75
00:03:51,670 --> 00:03:53,900
Well... no.

76
00:03:55,050 --> 00:03:59,210
I would imagine it'd be easier to 
guard us if we were all together.

77
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:05,460
Right this way, my good bishops!

78
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:09,220
Wait just a minute! 
What's that in your hand there?

79
00:04:09,220 --> 00:04:12,720
Just a drink to set the tone 
for this important duty.

80
00:04:12,770 --> 00:04:16,940
Archbishop Chloe

81
00:04:13,370 --> 00:04:15,190
Would you care for some, Your Grace?

82
00:04:16,970 --> 00:04:19,760
Fool! And you're supposed to protect us?!

83
00:04:19,760 --> 00:04:21,230
So sorry about that, sir!

84
00:04:28,790 --> 00:04:35,750
Episode 19: The Great Advent Festival

85
00:04:39,050 --> 00:04:40,260
Father.

86
00:04:40,570 --> 00:04:43,390
The Pope will be arriving soon.

87
00:04:43,390 --> 00:04:46,740
It's been so long since I've seen Guitane.

88
00:04:46,740 --> 00:04:49,010
You've known each other 
for a long time, right?

89
00:04:49,010 --> 00:04:55,030
Oh yes, long before I was king 
and Guitane became pope.

90
00:04:55,950 --> 00:05:00,100
<i>If one of the bishops is 
the mysterious pastor...</i>

91
00:05:00,510 --> 00:05:06,280
<i>Splitting them up like this should remove 
any chance of assassinating the pope.</i>

92
00:05:06,910 --> 00:05:09,690
<i>Here's hoping there're 
no unexpected twists...</i>

93
00:05:11,890 --> 00:05:14,410
His Holiness's coach has arrived.

94
00:05:18,250 --> 00:05:20,670
It's good to see you again, Your Holiness.

95
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:23,970
I hope you can forgive any 
offenses I may have caused.

96
00:05:23,970 --> 00:05:25,930
Oh, Albert!

97
00:05:26,220 --> 00:05:28,130
You've grown so much.

98
00:05:29,580 --> 00:05:31,140
Guitane!

99
00:05:31,140 --> 00:05:32,550
Charles!

100
00:05:32,550 --> 00:05:35,600
When I heard you'd be personally 
inspecting the church,

101
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:38,160
I made sure our schedules would line up!

102
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:42,060
I'm sure you're just here for 
your daughter's recital.

103
00:05:43,190 --> 00:05:46,210
It's true, I do love Saria.

104
00:05:46,210 --> 00:05:48,370
Despite her getting my name 
wrong, occasionally...

105
00:05:48,370 --> 00:05:48,850
Chan!

106
00:05:48,450 --> 00:05:54,080
Chan!!

107
00:05:48,850 --> 00:05:51,040
It's Charles, your daddy, dear!

108
00:05:48,950 --> 00:05:54,080
It's Charles, your daddy, dear♥

109
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:54,070
Oh? Shouldn't you be angry 
about that sort of thing?

110
00:05:54,300 --> 00:05:58,000
There's actually something I'm looking 
forward to even more, today.

111
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:58,780
What's that?

112
00:05:58,780 --> 00:06:01,410
Gentlemen, perhaps you should 
discuss this inside?

113
00:06:02,510 --> 00:06:04,800
<i>I can't help being anxious.</i>

114
00:06:04,800 --> 00:06:07,200
<i>Considering how light security is...</i>

115
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:10,390
Actually, do you not 
sing anymore yourself?

116
00:06:07,580 --> 00:06:11,570
<i>There's a prohibition on weapons 
inside of the Advent Festival.</i>

117
00:06:10,390 --> 00:06:13,390
Oh, come now... that's ancient history.

118
00:06:12,250 --> 00:06:15,870
<i>You would think that'd make 
things more safe, but...</i>

119
00:06:13,390 --> 00:06:16,730
I guess being Pope leaves you 
with little time for music.

120
00:06:17,850 --> 00:06:21,110
Given that the enemy can shapeshift,

121
00:06:21,700 --> 00:06:24,020
this likeness might not be of much use.

122
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:26,940
But does anything come to mind?

123
00:06:28,750 --> 00:06:29,860
No.

124
00:06:30,640 --> 00:06:32,950
Well, more like it's inconceivable.

125
00:06:32,950 --> 00:06:38,190
I understand the situation, but it's too 
late to cancel the Advent Festival.

126
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:42,930
You'll have to proceed with the 
investigation after it's over...

127
00:06:45,040 --> 00:06:49,510
You can arrange security to your liking 
on the day of, in the meantime.

128
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:53,450
If anything happens...

129
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:53,850
I might not compare to 
you, Your Majesty...

130
00:06:53,850 --> 00:06:55,340
I'm counting on you.

131
00:06:53,850 --> 00:06:56,590
But I'm not who I used to be, either.

132
00:06:57,240 --> 00:07:00,600
<i>Here's hoping nothing happens...</i>

133
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:02,600
<i>Let the event play out, 
let the people enjoy themselves.</i>

134
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:06,310
<i>And then everyone comes back safely.</i>

135
00:07:07,650 --> 00:07:11,350
Has there always been a cutie 
like her at this church?

136
00:07:11,350 --> 00:07:14,040
Wait, that's a sister?!

137
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:17,320
Well, she arrived with 
Bishop Anastasia, didn't she?

138
00:07:17,320 --> 00:07:19,080
Really...?

139
00:07:19,940 --> 00:07:23,230
You seem to be getting 
more attention than I am.

140
00:07:24,340 --> 00:07:28,880
Would you consider joining the 
cloth instead of being a maid?

141
00:07:31,570 --> 00:07:33,980
<i>Archbishop Anastasia.</i>

142
00:07:34,430 --> 00:07:38,380
<i>If you are the mysterious pastor, 
or are working with him...</i>

143
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:41,540
<i>that would be the worst-case scenario.</i>

144
00:07:42,370 --> 00:07:44,700
A different outfit?

145
00:07:44,700 --> 00:07:52,170
Yes, if you're going to be guarding me 
all day, then you should look the part.

146
00:07:52,750 --> 00:07:57,540
Understood. If you would loan me a habit...

147
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:05,040
I know it's for my protection, but you 
really shouldn't have this kind of thing.

148
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:09,560
Let's find a habit with a 
shorter skirt, for you.

149
00:08:11,230 --> 00:08:14,300
<i>She's as sharp as I'd heard.</i>

150
00:08:14,300 --> 00:08:16,540
<i>And she works directly for the pope...</i>

151
00:08:16,900 --> 00:08:19,700
<i>The closest woman to him.</i>

152
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:22,110
<i>I'll just have to pray...</i>

153
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:26,310
<i>That she isn't an enemy.</i>

154
00:08:26,630 --> 00:08:31,310
<i>Good grief. Even without a sword, 
she gives off this intensity.</i>

155
00:08:31,820 --> 00:08:40,310
Rumble

156
00:08:32,150 --> 00:08:37,640
<i>The other bishops were in groups of two 
per their guards, but I'm here alone...</i>

157
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:41,210
<i>And with the Silver Blader, no less.</i>

158
00:08:41,210 --> 00:08:44,320
<i>This will make getting anything 
done extremely difficult.</i>

159
00:08:45,450 --> 00:08:49,580
<i>I'm also a bit curious about the crows that
haven't flown from the roof, despite the rain.</i>

160
00:08:50,140 --> 00:08:53,330
<i>But... it shouldn't pose any real problem.</i>

161
00:08:53,330 --> 00:08:58,600
<i>You all should have imagined multiple 
levels beyond the worst-case scenario.</i>

162
00:09:06,350 --> 00:09:08,230
Looks like it's starting.

163
00:09:09,090 --> 00:09:12,110
Not the kind of performance 
I'd expect from a church!

164
00:09:12,110 --> 00:09:14,380
What are those? Bass drums?

165
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:48,660
What was that?! What happened?!

166
00:09:49,290 --> 00:09:50,370
Guards!

167
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:52,660
What?! What happened?

168
00:09:52,660 --> 00:09:54,200
Everyone, remain calm...

169
00:09:56,380 --> 00:09:58,060
Something's going on outside...

170
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:01,370
It's the gates of hell.

171
00:10:01,820 --> 00:10:04,690
That was the sound of them 
breaking open, Charles.

172
00:10:05,630 --> 00:10:11,380
I was hoping you'd have a priority 
seat to watch this show.

173
00:10:15,180 --> 00:10:18,020
I Was Reincarnated as the 7th Prince

174
00:10:15,180 --> 00:10:18,020
so I Can Take My Time
Perfecting My Magical Ability 2nd Season

175
00:10:33,430 --> 00:10:35,800
Forgive me for the imposition 
during such a trying time.

176
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:42,150
But we consider you a candidate 
to be the next pope...

177
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:48,340
Will you undergo the 
ritual to become pope...

178
00:10:49,280 --> 00:10:50,480
Guitane?

179
00:10:53,290 --> 00:10:58,340
This involves bathing 
you with our Luma Maxima.

180
00:10:58,790 --> 00:11:03,170
If you are able to withstand it while 
maintaining purity of heart...

181
00:11:03,590 --> 00:11:07,910
then you are, without a doubt, 
a saint... and worthy of being pope.

182
00:11:08,700 --> 00:11:10,440
Luma Maxima.

183
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:24,580
There are no shadows in my soul.

184
00:11:24,910 --> 00:11:28,340
Nothing to repent for.

185
00:11:30,950 --> 00:11:34,540
Magnificent! He is truly remarkable!

186
00:11:34,540 --> 00:11:37,310
Not even the slightest reaction!

187
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:41,720
Imagine, not having even the slightest 
speck of wickedness in your soul!

188
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:44,780
Especially after what happened!

189
00:11:50,010 --> 00:11:51,080
<i>They were wrong.</i>

190
00:11:53,210 --> 00:11:56,980
<i>In that moment, 
something was confirmed for me.</i>

191
00:11:57,510 --> 00:12:01,830
<i>That the black, coiling sensation 
I felt taking root within me</i>

192
00:12:01,830 --> 00:12:05,930
<i>was far more wicked than how 
the gods defined evil.</i>

193
00:12:06,890 --> 00:12:11,490
<i>And that no ray of light 
could ever reach it.</i>

194
00:12:13,590 --> 00:12:17,940
<i>My faith in that abyss runs 
as deeply as its depths.</i>

195
00:12:20,780 --> 00:12:24,770
Things seem to be quite 
noisy outside, Charles.

196
00:12:25,620 --> 00:12:31,270
I had originally planned for chimeras to 
emerge from beneath this church, too, but...

197
00:12:31,270 --> 00:12:34,700
Albert already dismantled that facility.

198
00:12:36,040 --> 00:12:38,730
It won't pose a problem, though.

199
00:12:38,730 --> 00:12:42,290
My forces will wash over 
this country like a wave...

200
00:12:42,290 --> 00:12:44,050
What's with the hole?

201
00:12:44,050 --> 00:12:45,410
It opened up out of nowhere.

202
00:12:45,850 --> 00:12:47,840
Until it is submerged...

203
00:12:48,820 --> 00:12:50,630
and annihilated.

204
00:12:51,780 --> 00:12:54,330
Run! Monsters!

205
00:12:58,550 --> 00:12:59,920
<i>Unbelievable!</i>

206
00:13:00,420 --> 00:13:02,860
<i>The person we were protecting is 
the one we should've gone after!</i>

207
00:13:03,610 --> 00:13:07,480
<i>It's Father we should have been protecting!</i>

208
00:13:07,930 --> 00:13:10,560
You'll be next, Albert.

209
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:13,670
Considering you are the heir 
to King Charles's will...

210
00:13:15,070 --> 00:13:18,950
Though to be honest, I intend on eliminating 
everyone who abides by God's will.

211
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:23,940
This nation's laws were constructed 
on a basis of divine teachings.

212
00:13:24,390 --> 00:13:28,000
"Do not kill. Do not deceive. Do not steal."

213
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:31,700
All these things that everyone 
takes for granted...

214
00:13:32,520 --> 00:13:34,960
And all of it's wrong.

215
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:39,090
Killing, stealing... 
None of it matters, you see.

216
00:13:40,040 --> 00:13:42,220
If the will behind them is pure...

217
00:13:43,660 --> 00:13:44,720
Guitane!

218
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:46,650
That voice...

219
00:13:46,650 --> 00:13:49,210
I believe this is our first time meeting,

220
00:13:49,900 --> 00:13:51,850
Angel Jihriel.

221
00:13:52,390 --> 00:13:55,450
And after everything I've 
done, your boss...

222
00:13:56,210 --> 00:13:59,480
God, still refuses to descend 
to earth, it seems.

223
00:14:00,010 --> 00:14:05,230
I was hoping my rampage might have 
been enough to compel God's intervention.

224
00:14:05,230 --> 00:14:07,580
What did this to you?!

225
00:14:07,580 --> 00:14:10,740
Depending on your answer, I may
have to cast judgment on you myself!

226
00:14:11,030 --> 00:14:16,450
Is that one of the sacred envoys 
that bestows divine sorcery?

227
00:14:16,450 --> 00:14:17,350
What is this?!

228
00:14:17,350 --> 00:14:18,380
His Holiness?!

229
00:14:18,700 --> 00:14:20,990
<i>Perhaps I can restrain him 
with that kind of help?</i>

230
00:14:20,990 --> 00:14:23,520
<i>There's one enemy... and Father is there...</i>

231
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:25,790
<i>Can we manage this without 
harming Father or the guests?</i>

232
00:14:29,230 --> 00:14:31,900
I don't owe you any answers.

233
00:14:32,890 --> 00:14:34,090
No...

234
00:14:35,230 --> 00:14:36,450
What is that?!

235
00:14:36,450 --> 00:14:37,860
The King!

236
00:14:39,150 --> 00:14:41,570
Is that a monster?! But it's the Pope!

237
00:14:41,570 --> 00:14:42,900
Someone get some soldiers!

238
00:14:42,900 --> 00:14:45,730
When I saw that likeness...

239
00:14:45,730 --> 00:14:49,410
it reminded me of how you 
looked when you were young.

240
00:14:49,410 --> 00:14:51,090
Or rather...

241
00:14:51,660 --> 00:14:57,160
It brought to mind what your boy would 
have looked like... had he lived.

242
00:14:57,460 --> 00:15:01,920
Is that what happened... to change you so?

243
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:03,920
Charles.

244
00:15:04,160 --> 00:15:07,730
Are you satisfied with 
those as your last words?

245
00:15:08,470 --> 00:15:09,920
Father!

246
00:15:10,490 --> 00:15:12,300
Your Majesty!

247
00:15:14,600 --> 00:15:20,800
Sir Angel... never mind me... save Albert!

248
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:24,260
And let my two children know...

249
00:15:24,260 --> 00:15:27,560
that I'm sorry I couldn't 
witness their recital!

250
00:15:27,560 --> 00:15:29,380
Angel! Don't worry about me!

251
00:15:29,380 --> 00:15:31,890
My Father! Protect my Father!

252
00:15:33,490 --> 00:15:35,120
No need to worry.

253
00:15:35,120 --> 00:15:38,360
The entire royal family will be 
sent to the heavens...

254
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:40,470
And you'll be able to listen 
to the performance from there.

255
00:15:40,470 --> 00:15:42,510
Your children's sweet music.

256
00:15:42,510 --> 00:15:44,710
Save my father!

257
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:48,710
<i>Wait... His... </i>two<i> children?</i>

258
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:59,990
Having taken my leave from 
Paradise without permission...

259
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:06,100
This is who I serve... in the mortal realm.

260
00:16:26,750 --> 00:16:30,430
<i>Thinking back, it was that moment 
where we passed by each other.</i>

261
00:16:34,590 --> 00:16:39,020
<i>That boy who appeared behind me so suddenly.</i>

262
00:16:39,410 --> 00:16:41,200
<i>The chill he gave me...</i>

263
00:16:41,200 --> 00:16:43,140
<i>What I had overlooked...</i>

264
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:46,260
<i>Could I have even imagined such 
a wonderful miscalculation?</i>

265
00:16:46,260 --> 00:16:50,290
<i>As a human, I could not 
reach the heavens.</i>

266
00:16:50,290 --> 00:16:54,240
<i>So I would raise my banner of rebellion 
by snuffing out a nation...</i>

267
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:56,740
<i>And the faith in the god that it follows.</i>

268
00:16:56,740 --> 00:17:00,460
<i>Or perhaps, destroying the country</i>

269
00:17:00,460 --> 00:17:04,840
<i>would give God cause to descend 
in an attempt to judge me.</i>

270
00:17:04,840 --> 00:17:08,290
<i>I'd been clinging to that 
faint hope for so long.</i>

271
00:17:14,610 --> 00:17:19,890
I'm so grateful. With your death,
my descent into the abyss will be complete.

272
00:17:22,770 --> 00:17:25,820
Someone who could make me feel this way...

273
00:17:25,820 --> 00:17:28,570
Descending upon me, with 
an angel in his service...

274
00:17:28,570 --> 00:17:31,610
If you are not a god, then what are you?

275
00:17:32,910 --> 00:17:34,580
I'm just a prince.

276
00:17:35,380 --> 00:17:36,760
The seventh one, at that.

277
00:17:37,660 --> 00:17:38,830
Boom

278
00:17:39,220 --> 00:17:40,070
What the—?!

279
00:17:44,900 --> 00:17:49,010
Father?! Al?! Where'd you come from?!

280
00:17:49,010 --> 00:17:51,770
Dian?! Is this Saloum Castle?

281
00:17:51,770 --> 00:17:53,840
What in the world...?

282
00:17:53,840 --> 00:17:56,360
I should be asking that!

283
00:17:56,360 --> 00:17:59,340
Does this have anything to do with 
the commotion in the streets?

284
00:17:59,630 --> 00:18:02,360
That's right, Dian! I need your help!

285
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:05,080
Father...

286
00:18:06,960 --> 00:18:10,330
The enemy can change his form at will.

287
00:18:10,900 --> 00:18:15,570
That's why I'm sure he was just 
disguising himself as His Holiness!

288
00:18:16,110 --> 00:18:17,290
No...

289
00:18:20,150 --> 00:18:21,770
You're right.

290
00:18:22,340 --> 00:18:25,370
It must be an impostor.

291
00:18:25,630 --> 00:18:28,460
Notify all soldiers in the castle!

292
00:18:28,460 --> 00:18:31,380
Our enemy has occupied the Daen Cathedral!

293
00:18:31,750 --> 00:18:34,890
Defend our citizens at all costs!

294
00:18:38,320 --> 00:18:40,770
<i>Seeing him in person made it clear.</i>

295
00:18:41,140 --> 00:18:44,370
<i>Clear how little I understand, rather.</i>

296
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:48,960
<i>Mana condensation and manipulation 
of his mana apertures...</i>

297
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:52,220
<i>To conceal his presence, he is 
expending a massive amount of mana</i>

298
00:18:52,220 --> 00:18:54,820
<i>with each passing second, pointlessly.</i>

299
00:18:55,900 --> 00:19:00,150
<i>You've a knack for hiding your 
presence... much like I do.</i>

300
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:04,150
Prince Lloyd! Escher and 
Princess Saria are safe!

301
00:19:04,150 --> 00:19:05,260
All right.

302
00:19:05,810 --> 00:19:08,520
I want the two of you to help the 
people fighting in the city.

303
00:19:09,160 --> 00:19:12,610
There are way more chimeras running 
amok than I anticipated.

304
00:19:12,610 --> 00:19:15,390
And I'm going to have my 
hands full with this guy.

305
00:19:16,110 --> 00:19:19,370
Please, wait! This is personal for me!

306
00:19:19,370 --> 00:19:20,840
Please, allow me to—

307
00:19:20,840 --> 00:19:22,810
You can't beat him.

308
00:19:24,270 --> 00:19:26,180
<i>Is that how tough he is?</i>

309
00:19:27,450 --> 00:19:29,000
It just occurred to me,

310
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:32,790
couldn't you teleport to the mysterious 
pastor by detecting his mana?

311
00:19:32,790 --> 00:19:35,180
Not with how short our 
little encounter was...

312
00:19:35,770 --> 00:19:38,660
Plus, his mana gave off the 
faintest presence at the time.

313
00:19:38,660 --> 00:19:43,420
Looking back, he probably does the 
same thing I do... conceals it.

314
00:19:44,190 --> 00:19:47,810
<i>He's definitely suppressing his mana.</i>

315
00:19:47,810 --> 00:19:51,960
<i>He might be on par with a demon... 
maybe even a Demon Lord!</i>

316
00:19:52,180 --> 00:19:53,710
I'm gonna have to pass.

317
00:19:54,090 --> 00:19:57,610
You're gonna do some crazy crap 
like fight without a barrier

318
00:19:57,610 --> 00:19:59,550
to sample his attacks 
if I leave, aren't you?

319
00:19:59,550 --> 00:20:00,210
Will not!

320
00:20:00,210 --> 00:20:01,340
You promise?!

321
00:20:01,340 --> 00:20:02,100
I do!

322
00:20:02,360 --> 00:20:03,840
You better not, then!

323
00:20:07,920 --> 00:20:09,550
Come on, Jihriel!

324
00:20:12,900 --> 00:20:15,430
Unholy Excalibur.

325
00:20:19,390 --> 00:20:22,790
You're not going anywhere, Jihri—

326
00:20:35,670 --> 00:20:38,790
Mana focus: Impulsa Incinis.

327
00:21:02,310 --> 00:21:03,750
Divine Septuple.

328
00:21:31,940 --> 00:21:33,050
Guitane.

329
00:21:33,930 --> 00:21:37,810
There's a whole lot that I'd 
like to discuss with you.

330
00:21:38,150 --> 00:21:42,730
But before that... there's something I've 
been wanting to tell you in person.

331
00:21:51,330 --> 00:21:53,170
You've crossed a line.

332
00:23:35,630 --> 00:23:37,790
<i>I'm a rainy fellow.</i>

333
00:23:37,790 --> 00:23:42,880
<i>And it feels like no matter how much it rains, 
it can never quench what I feel in my heart...</i>

334
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:44,940
<i>Next time, Episode 20:</i>

335
00:23:44,940 --> 00:23:46,330
<i>"Invasion."</i>

336
00:23:44,940 --> 00:23:50,150
Episode 20

337
00:23:44,940 --> 00:23:50,150
m 0 0 l 436 0 l 456 24 l 436 48 l 20 48 l 0 24 l 20 0

338
00:23:44,940 --> 00:23:50,150
Invasion

339
00:23:46,330 --> 00:23:49,560
<i>You will witness the depths of sorcery.</i>

